Rāvaṇa blazes hearing Kumbha and Nikumbha slain --- Rāvaṇa orders Khara son Makarākṣa to kill Rāma Lakṣmaṇa --- Makarākṣa honors Rāvaṇa mounts chariot and musters army --- Makarākṣa boasts he will kill Rāma Lakṣmaṇa Sugrīva and burn host --- Rākṣasa host surrounds Makarākṣa shaking earth with drums --- Goad and banner fall horses stumble and harsh wind blows --- Ignoring dire omens Rākṣasas march toward Rāma Lakṣmaṇa